    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/b5960ed8b687091b2ba4725e6947a600.poster.avif?t=1751963291\" width=516 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/b5960ed8b687091b2ba4725e6947a600.webm?t=1751963291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maze, combine and conquer in <strong>Gem Miner TD</strong>, an indie tower defense game that puts you in the role of a crafty miner tasked with creating deadly mazes, combining powerful gems, and surviving waves of relentless enemies. With unique roguelike elements, every playthrough is a new adventure filled with strategic decisions and dazzling chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft Your Maze\u00a0-</strong> Mine blocks to create intricate paths. Adjacent blocks become ore, transformable into powerful defensive gems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Defense -</strong>\u00a0Place gems to shoot down waves of enemies as they attempt to drag your miner to the lava pits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Gem System -</strong> Combine gems of varying rarities to create increasingly powerful defenses \u2014 the more you combine, the mightier your defenses become.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Elements -</strong> After specific waves, choose from roguelike-style upgrades to customize your playstyle. Enhance your gems, empower your miner, or alter gameplay mechanics for a unique experience every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Challenges -</strong> Multiple maps, numerous miners, countless gem combinations, powerful augments, and varied enemy types make every playthrough feel fresh and exciting.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Maze...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/88558680005e85fca49446843384c829.poster.avif?t=1751963291\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/88558680005e85fca49446843384c829.webm?t=1751963291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/88558680005e85fca49446843384c829.mp4?t=1751963291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combine...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/471df72876d62024eda65940f2329f6d.poster.avif?t=1751963291\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/471df72876d62024eda65940f2329f6d.webm?t=1751963291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/471df72876d62024eda65940f2329f6d.mp4?t=1751963291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conquer!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/b2e6eea0b54895f4be91956b7148f7a2.poster.avif?t=1751963291\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/b2e6eea0b54895f4be91956b7148f7a2.webm?t=1751963291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/b2e6eea0b54895f4be91956b7148f7a2.mp4?t=1751963291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful pixel graphics, deep strategy, and endless replayability await. Easy to play, hard to master! Are you ready to maze, combine and conquer? A tower defense where gem combinations and mazing lead to victory - wishlist now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/8be2588489e2386999c7dcef9f6e1b1e.poster.avif?t=1751963291\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/8be2588489e2386999c7dcef9f6e1b1e.webm?t=1751963291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Join our Discord server!</p>",
