y types make every playthrough feel fresh and exciting.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Maze...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/88558680005e85fca49446843384c829.poster.avif?t=1751963291\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/88558680005e85fca49446843384c829.webm?t=1751963291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/88558680005e85fca49446843384c829.mp4?t=1751963291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combine...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/471df72876d62024eda65940f2329f6d.poster.avif?t=1751963291\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/471df72876d62024eda65940f2329f6d.webm?t=1751963291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/471df72876d62024eda65940f2329f6d.mp4?t=1751963291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conquer!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/b2e6eea0b54895f4be91956b7148f7a2.poster.avif?t=1751963291\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/b2e6eea0b54895f4be91956b7148f7a2.webm?t=1751963291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/b2e6eea0b54895f4be91956b7148f7a2.mp4?t=1751963291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful pixel graphics, deep strategy, and endless replayability await. Easy to play, hard to master! Are you ready to maze, combine and conquer? A tower defense where gem combinations and mazing lead to victory - wishlist now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/8be2588489e2386999c7dcef9f6e1b1e.poster.avif?t=1751963291\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/8be2588489e2386999c7dcef9f6e1b1e.webm?t=1751963291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Join our Discord server!</p>",
